  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/nh-rsa-data/blob/96bd0a247d4463e2ae692310c0fdd17ec563a46c/rsa_html/LXIII/655/655-16.htm",
  "statuteText": "655:16 Personal Filing. –\n\nExcept for those who must file with a town or city clerk, any person who files on the last day of the filing period must do so in person before the secretary of state; provided, however, that this requirement shall not apply to the filling of vacancies by party committees. If the person must file with a town or city clerk and is filing on the last day of the filing period, he or she shall do so in person.\nExcept for those who must file with a town or city clerk, any person who files on the last day of the filing period must do so in person before the secretary of state."
}
